			"Message": "style(Output): Standardize indentation in polyfills and build scripts\n\nReformat shell script helpers (`Run.sh`, `prepublishOnly.sh`) and Eager polyfill TypeScript files (`Activation`, `Idle/Value`, `Lifecycle/Phase`, `Telemetry/Consent/Off`) to use consistent single-tab indentation. Adjust `case` statement bodies, `exit` handlers, and multiline `_CELLog` string arguments to align with project standards.\n\nAdditionally, refactor the `_TierIPC` resolution logic in `Service/Tauri/Main/Process/Service.ts` to use a consistent safe navigation pattern for `__LandTiers`. This ensures the codebase maintains uniform whitespace discipline and robust environment variable fallbacks without altering any build logic or diagnostic routing behavior.",
